(:sections nil :text
	   ("Each Series will be an employees’ securities company within the meaning of Section 2(a)(13) of the 1940 Act."
	    "Each Investment Adviser to an ESC Fund shall comply with the standards prescribed in Sections 9, 36 and 37 of the 1940 Act."
	    "Upon prior written notice, the General Partner may require payment of all or any part of a deferred payment."
	    "The annual financial statement will be audited9 by independent certified public accountants."
	    "Marshall Wace will control the ESC Fund within the meaning of Section 2(a)(9) of the 1940 Act."
	    "The Applicant named below has caused this Application to be duly signed on its behalf on May 11, 2026."))
